  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'Are the sets C = {x : x − 5 = 0} and E = {x : x is an integral positive root of the equation x² − 2x − 15 = 0} equal? (3 marks)', 'C: x − 5 = 0 gives x = 5, so C = {5}. E: x² − 2x − 15 = (x − 5)(x + 3) = 0, so x = 5 or x = −3; the only positive integral root is 5, so E = {5}. Both sets have exactly the same element, so C = E.', null, '[{"point": "C = {5}", "marks": 1}, {"point": "x² − 2x − 15 = (x − 5)(x + 3) = 0 → roots 5, −3; positive integral root 5 → E = {5}", "marks": 1.5}, {"point": "Same elements, so C = E", "marks": 0.5}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
