  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'How has artificial intelligence advanced? State the impact of artificial intelligence in the world today. (3 marks)', 'Advances: AI has moved from early rule-based ''expert systems'' to machine learning, where computers learn patterns from data, and to deep learning with neural networks, made possible by huge datasets and powerful processors (GPUs/ cloud). Today generative AI and large language models (such as ChatGPT) can write text and code, translate and summarise; computer vision recognises images and faces; speech assistants understand voice; and AI drives robots and self-driving vehicles.
